WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.200
Read the workflow purpose. This screen stores workflow configuration only. Saving it does not run a workflow or send messages. Review the intended audience and purpose.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:26.400
Review trigger and conditions. Check the recorded trigger, audience and delay. These describe the intended process; they do not prove that an action will execute.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:39.600
Review the proposed action. Inspect delay, channel, template and review requirement. A configured workflow is not authorization to send real messages.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:52.800
Verify actual outcomes. Saved workflow history alone is not proof of execution. Verify sends and delivery in the actual communication workflow.

